---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base
  title="About & contact | Davis Dog Farm"
  description="About Davis Dog Farm, an all-breed foster-based dog rescue in Grantville, PA. Contact info and partners."
>
  <section class="page-head">
    <div class="wrap split">
      <div>
        <h1>About us</h1>
        <p>Davis Dog Farm Inc. is a nonprofit, all-breed dog rescue in Grantville, PA, founded in 2021.</p>
        <p>We take in dogs from local shelter partners, high-kill shelters in nearby states, owner surrenders, and other rescues that need help. Most of our dogs live in foster homes so they can get used to family life instead of waiting in a kennel. Some also get training to improve their chances of finding a forever home.</p>
      </div>
      <img class="tall" src="/images/dog-autumn-leaves.jpg" alt="A happy black and tan dog standing in autumn leaves" width="900" height="1200">
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-white" id="military">
    <div class="wrap split flip">
      <div>
        <h2>Temporary foster for service members</h2>
        <p>If you’re in the military, or your job sends you overseas, we can place your dog in a foster home until you’re back in the States. Thank you for your service.</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="btn btn-plain" href="mailto:info@davisdogfarm.com?subject=Temporary%20foster">Email us about temporary foster</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <img src="/images/adopt-me-snow-2.jpg" alt="A dog in a vest standing in the snow" width="828" height="552" loading="lazy">
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="partners">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Our partners</h2>
      <div class="partners">
        <a href="https://maxxk9academy.com">
          <img src="/images/partner-maxx-k9.jpg" alt="" width="400" height="399" loading="lazy">
          <h3>Maxx K9 Academy</h3>
          <p>Dog training, pet supplies, and pet first aid and CPR.</p>
        </a>
        <a href="https://herehannah.com">
          <img src="/images/partner-here-hannah.jpg" alt="" width="600" height="340" loading="lazy">
          <h3>Here Hannah Pet Sitting</h3>
          <p>In-home pet care.</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section-ink" id="contact">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Contact us</h2>
      <p class="muted">Visits are by appointment only. Please don’t come to any location without one. If you want to meet a dog, <a href="/adopt/">apply first</a> and we’ll reach out.</p>
      <div class="contact-grid" style="margin-top:2rem">
        <div>
          <h3>Email</h3>
          <p><a href="mailto:info@davisdogfarm.com">info@davisdogfarm.com</a></p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Address</h3>
          <p>2686 Sand Beach Road<br>Grantville, PA 17028<br><a href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=2686+Sand+Beach+Road+Grantville+PA+17028">Get directions</a></p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Hours</h3>
          <p>9 am to 7 pm, by appointment<br><a href="https://www.facebook.com/102837875139459">Message us on Facebook</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
